      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5be2560065138b146246eedb|full_name}: avatars flying usually make use of colliders, but it doesn't work anymore, it was broken in an update a while ago, and you can easily distinguish between that type of flying and the hacked clients one.\nIf you do a quick google search anyone can easily find these clients and their \"features\".\nAs for the loggout, the devs already said that IPs are \"supposed\" to be exposed and you have to use a VPN to defend yourself temporarily. This doesn't seem like they're working on it, more like completely neglecting the problem. Afaik these new client users are not able to crash you through their thing, they mostly steal avatars, fly around, ddos, and crash with the usual particles + colliders but you have the safety system for that",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
